TELETEXTER V1.0
===============


What is Teletexter?
-------------------
 Teletexter is a program that can send text messages to your I2C LCD Display
 from a TCP/IP connection, it is highly customizable where you can set the layout
 for your messages the way you want. It supports most I2C displays out there.
 You can also send 100% custom messages for each line.


 Client Commands:

IDENT <username> <password
  Description:

  Success: 201 (LOGIN_OK)
  Errors: 307 (INVALID_CREDENTIALS) - Wrong username & password.
          303 (MISSING_ARGS)        - Missing either username or password.
          300 (GENERAL_ERR)         - Somthing not related to the login failed.
              

MSG <"Message">
 Description: Sends a message from the identified user to the display 
 
   Success: 200 (MSG_SET_OK)
   Errors: 303 (MISSING_ARGS)        - You have not specified a message

MSG_CUSTOM <align> <line> <"Message">
  Description: Send any message to any line on the display
  Arguments: <align> - REQUIRED - Set the alignment of the text to either: LEFT, RIGHT or CENTER
             <line>  - REQUIRED - Which line to set the text at.
             <"Message"> - REQUIRED - The message you want to show.


MSG_CLEAR
  Description: Clears the whole display

MSG_CLEAR <line>
  Description: Clears display line number <line> (1 to 4)
